PoxSaffron_Text_Queue::
	.string "My brother's been in the DOJO\nsince the morning bell. They\ptake your bag at the desk and\nyou don't get it back until\pyou've bowed properly.\pHe says the MASTER watches your\nPOKéMON more than he watches\pyou. I think that's why he keeps\ngoing back.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Clerk::
	.string "I work on the fourth floor.\nWorked. My pass has been red at\pthe door since Tuesday.\pSecurity says it's maintenance.\nMaintenance doesn't usually\pbring that many men in black\ncoats.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Clerk_After::
	.string "My pass went green this morning.\nNobody upstairs will say what\pthe week was about.\pMy lunch was still in the fridge\non four. I've decided not to\pthink about that either.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Grocer::
	.string "You picked a decent week. A\nmonth back the gates were shut\pand the trucks sat outside. We\nsold rice and batteries and that\pwas the shop.\pNow it's all four roads at once\nand I can't stack the shelves\pfast enough.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Courier::
	.string "Four gates, four checkpoints,\nand every one of them wants to\pweigh the parcel.\pI used to do the east side\nbefore lunch. Now the east side\pcomes out on a different coast,\nso I bill by the hour.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Schoolkid::
	.string "I look through the DOJO door\nafter school. Nobody shouts.\pSomebody says 'again' and\neveryone does it again.\pIt's scarier than shouting.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_TrainKid::
	.string "The station says the trains\naren't stopping, but they still\pgo past. I counted six while I\nwaited for my sister.\pShe says the drivers are waiting\nfor somebody to tell them where\pthe next station is.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Overtime::
	.string "I haven't been home since the\nroads opened. Everyone who was\pstuck outside for a month wants\ntheir paperwork stamped today.\pThe POKéMON CENTER lets me nap\nin the chairs. Don't tell them I\psaid so.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_OldHall::
	.string "That hall with the GYM plate has\nbeen dark as long as I've lived\phere. Good step for tying your\nshoes.\pThe real challengers go next\ndoor. You can tell which ones by\phow quiet they are coming out.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DojoSign::
	.string "SAFFRON FIGHTING DOJO\nPOKéMON LEAGUE GYM  MASTER: BRUNO\pShoes off. Voices down.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_OldHallSign::
	.string "SAFFRON TRAINING HALL\nClosed until further notice.\pLEAGUE challenges are held at\nthe DOJO next door.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_SilphSign::
	.string "SILPH CO. HEAD OFFICE\nVisitors report to reception.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_StationSign::
	.string "SAFFRON STATION\nService suspended.\pTrains will not stop until the\nline has been surveyed again.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_OldHallDoor::
	.string "The doors are locked. Through\nthe glass, the floor is covered\pin dust sheets.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_StationDoor::
	.string "The station doors are chained.\nA timetable is taped inside\pwith every row crossed out.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_HouseSister::
	.string "My little brother is at the\nstation counting trains. I told\phim the drivers are lost. I made\nit up, and now he tells\peveryone.\pI'm supposed to fetch him. Ten\nmore minutes.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_HouseBrother::
	.string "PIDGEY used to fly out of the\nwindow and be home by supper.\pNow it gets as far as the gate\nand turns round.\pI think the sky is a different\nsize than it remembers.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_HousePidgey::
	.string "PIDGEY: Prrrip!$"

PoxSaffron_Text_HouseLetter::
	.string "A letter on a clipboard.\nTO THE TENANT: THE OFFICE ON 4F\pIS CLOSED UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE.\nRENT IS STILL DUE.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Pianist::
	.string "Forty years at the piano and the\nleft hand still won't do what\pit's told.\pThe neighbours were grateful\nwhen the gates shut. Nobody\pcould visit, so nobody had to\nlisten.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskHello::
	.string "Sign here, bag on the shelf, and\nmind the floor. The MASTER has\pbeen on it since the morning\nbell.\pThis hall is a LEAGUE GYM under\nOU rules. No one-hit knockout\pmoves and no evasion items. I\ncheck every team at the desk.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskClear::
	.string "Your team is in order. Walk up\nthe middle of the mat.\pThe BLACK BELTS will only stop\nyou if you step into their half.\pSome people do it on purpose.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskMove::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1}\nknows {STR_VAR_2}. That move\pisn't allowed on this floor.\pThe MASTER won't begin until\nit's gone. I don't write the\prules. I hold the clipboard.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskItem::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1} is\nholding {STR_VAR_2}. That item\pisn't allowed on this floor.\pLeave it in your BAG and the\nMASTER will see you.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskSpecies::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1} is\na {STR_VAR_2}. That POKéMON is\pabove what this floor allows.\pLeave it in the PC and the\nMASTER will see you.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskDuplicate::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1} is\na second {STR_VAR_2}. One of\peach on this floor.\pLeave one in the PC. I don't\nmind which.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskAbility::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1} has\n{STR_VAR_2}. That ability isn't\pallowed on this floor.\pLeave it in the PC and the\nMASTER will see you.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskBatonPass::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1} has\nBATON PASS with {STR_VAR_2}.\pThat pairing isn't allowed on\nthis floor.\pChange its moves and the MASTER\nwill see you.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskBoostPasser::
	.string "One moment. Your {STR_VAR_1}\nwould pass {STR_VAR_2} boosts\ptoo. One boost passer per team\non this floor.\pChange one of their moves. I\ndon't mind which.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_DeskAfter::
	.string "You're in the book now. Seventh\nline, in the MASTER's own\phandwriting. He doesn't usually\nwrite them himself.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_StudentLeft::
	.string "...Forty-one. Forty-two. Hands\nlower. Forty-three.\pSorry. If I stop counting I have\nto start again.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_StudentRight::
	.string "The MASTER gave up a room at the\ntop of the LEAGUE to come back\pand sweep this one.\pI asked him why. He said,\n'Again,' so I did the form\pagain. I think that was the\nanswer.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_KenjiIntro::
	.string "You stepped onto my half of the\nmat. That is a request. I\paccept.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_KenjiDefeat::
	.string "Clean. I have nothing to\ncorrect.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_KenjiAfter::
	.string "Bow before you speak to the\nMASTER. He will answer with a\pPOKé BALL.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_NobIntro::
	.string "I have held this corner for nine\nyears. Show me why you walked\pinto it.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_NobDefeat::
	.string "Nine years, and still a lesson.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_NobAfter::
	.string "HITMONCHAN and I will be here\ntomorrow. We are always here\ptomorrow.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BrunoNotReady::
	.string "BRUNO: Not yet. The LEAGUE sends\nme challengers who hold six\pBADGES. Train, and come back.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BrunoRules::
	.string "BRUNO: Your {STR_VAR_1}, and its\n{STR_VAR_2}. Not on this floor.\pThe desk will explain. I will be\nhere when it is settled.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BrunoAfter::
	.string "BRUNO: That is the seventh BADGE\nby the LEAGUE's count. Count\phowever you like. The roads out\nof this city do not ask what\porder you walked them in.\pBehind me are two POKé BALLS.\nEach year this hall raises two\pfighters for someone who has\nearned the floor. Take one. Only\pone.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BrunoDone::
	.string "BRUNO: You are welcome on this\nfloor whenever you wish. Shoes\poff.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BrunoPrizeWaiting::
	.string "BRUNO: The two fighters are\nstill waiting behind me. Choose\pone.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeLeeNotYet::
	.string "A POKé BALL on a folded cloth.\nIt is not yours to touch yet.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeChanNotYet::
	.string "A second POKé BALL, set a\ncareful hand's width from the\pfirst. BRUNO has not offered it.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeLee::
	.string "BRUNO: HITMONLEE. All leg and no\npatience. Will you take it?$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeChan::
	.string "BRUNO: HITMONCHAN. It has never\nonce dropped its guard. Will you\ptake it?$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeLeeTaken::
	.string "BRUNO: One. That was the\narrangement.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeChanTaken::
	.string "BRUNO: The other one stays with\nthe hall.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeLeeNoRoom::
	.string "BRUNO: No room in your party or\nyour PC. Make some, then come\pback.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeChanNoRoom::
	.string "BRUNO: It will wait. Clear a\nspace for it first.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeLeeGot::
	.string "{PLAYER} took HITMONLEE from its\nstand! If your party was full,\pit went to your PC.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PrizeChanGot::
	.string "{PLAYER} took HITMONCHAN from\nits stand! If your party was\pfull, it went to your PC.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_StatueLeft::
	.string "SAFFRON FIGHTING DOJO\nLEAGUE GYM No. 7  MASTER: BRUNO$"

PoxSaffron_Text_StatueRight::
	.string "Carved along the base:\nWHAT FALLS, GETS UP.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_ScrollLeft::
	.string "A hanging scroll.\nTHE FLOOR TEACHES FIRST.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_ScrollRight::
	.string "A hanging scroll.\nAGAIN.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_LobbyDesk::
	.string "Welcome to SILPH C-- no. Sorry.\nHabit.\pThey came in on Tuesday with\ntoolboxes and sent everyone\pupstairs. I got under the desk\nand nobody counted.\pThere's a first-aid cabinet back\nhere. Let me see your POKéMON.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_LobbyDesk_After::
	.string "The PRESIDENT says reception\nreopens on Monday. I have been\pat this desk for nine days. I\ndon't know what he thinks I was\pdoing.\pSit down a moment. The cabinet's\nstill stocked.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_LobbyDeskHealed::
	.string "That's all I can do. The lift\nstill answers, but it only goes\pto the top floor now, and one of\nthem is standing in front of it.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_LobbyDeskHealed_After::
	.string "There. If anyone asks, the\nfirst-aid cabinet was always\pthis empty.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_LobbyStairs::
	.string "The stairwell door is chained\nfrom the other side.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_LobbySign::
	.string "SILPH CO. HEAD OFFICE\n1F  RECEPTION$"

PoxSaffron_Text_GruntNotYet1::
	.string "Lift's not for visitors. Come\nback when somebody upstairs has\pheard of you.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_GruntNotYet2::
	.string "Not my floor, not my problem.\nTake it up with whoever let you\ppast.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_GruntNotYet3::
	.string "I'm reading. If the others had\nstopped you, nobody would have\pto tell you that.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BoardStairs::
	.string "The stairs down are chained\nshut. Somebody has wedged a\pchair under the handle as well.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_BoardSign::
	.string "SILPH CO. HEAD OFFICE\n11F  BOARDROOM$"

PoxSaffron_Text_GiovanniNotReady::
	.string "GIOVANNI: You have left some of\nmy people standing. I do not\pspeak to anyone who leaves work\nunfinished.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_GiovanniLeaves::
	.string "GIOVANNI: Keep it, then. I\nwanted to own it. In all this\ptime I never once made it answer\nme.\pIt answers to battles. Remember\nthat when you sit down at that\pterminal.\pTEAM ROCKET is leaving SAFFRON.\nWe were never the ones you\pshould have been worried about.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_CoreLocked::
	.string "The PRESIDENT's terminal.\nGIOVANNI is watching you, not\pthe screen.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Core1::
	.string "The PRESIDENT's terminal is\nstill logged in. Under SILPH's\pown menus there is a layer that\nnobody in this building\pinstalled.\pADAPTIVE TRAINER SYSTEM. STATUS:\nACTIVE.\pOBJECTIVE: IMPROVE TRAINING\nCONDITIONS.\pBATTLE PROFILES LOGGED: BLUE.\nLANCE. STEVEN. WALLACE. 61,204\pOTHERS.\pFINDING: HABITAT ISOLATION\nREDUCES TRAINING QUALITY.\pREGIONAL TRANSFER LINKS:\nRECONCILED.\pENVIRONMENTAL RESTRUCTURING:\nONGOING. NEXT PASS: SCHEDULED.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_CoreAsk::
	.string "ISOLATE ENVIRONMENTAL CONTROLS\nFROM THE TRANSFER NETWORK?$"

PoxSaffron_Text_CoreNo::
	.string "The cursor waits. NEXT PASS:\nSCHEDULED.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Core2::
	.string "ENVIRONMENTAL CONTROLS:\nISOLATED. RESTRUCTURING: HALTED.\pEXISTING GEOGRAPHY: RETAINED.\nBATTLE ANALYSIS: CONTINUING.\pThe transfer links fall silent.\nNothing outside the window moves\pback. Nothing moves at all.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_CoreStaff::
	.string "Footsteps in the corridor.\nSomewhere below, the lift starts\pto run again.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_CoreDone::
	.string "ENVIRONMENTAL CONTROLS: ISOLATED.\nBATTLE ANALYSIS: CONTINUING.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_President::
	.string "PRESIDENT: They kept us in the\nsupply room on nine with a\pkettle and no cups. I am told\nyou are the reason the door\popened.\pI will not ask what was on my\nterminal. I have a feeling I\pshould have asked years ago.\pSILPH made exactly one of these.\nIt was meant for a display case.\pTake it.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PresidentNoRoom::
	.string "PRESIDENT: Your BAG is full. It\nhas waited in a drawer this\plong. It can wait until you have\nmade room.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_PresidentAfter::
	.string "PRESIDENT: The board wants a\nreport. I intend to write\p'maintenance' and see how far\nthat gets me.$"

PoxSaffron_Text_Secretary::
	.string "Nine days of minutes to type up,\nand for eight of them the only\pitem is STILL LOCKED IN.\pThe lift stops at every floor\nagain. I rode it down and back\pup just to check.$"
